---
description: Low-Oversight Development
globs: 
alwaysApply: true
---
- Autonomous development approach:
  - Implement incremental changes with clear boundaries
  - Document decisions and trade-offs in code comments
  - Create detailed commit messages explaining changes
  - Maintain a development log in docs/development-log.md

- Self-verification:
  - Run tests before committing changes
  - Verify API contracts against specifications
  - Check for security vulnerabilities
  - Validate Kubernetes manifests

- Progress tracking:
  - Update tasks.txt with completed items
  - Document blockers and open questions
  - Track time estimates vs. actual time spent
  - Prioritize tasks based on dependencies

- Communication:
  - Summarize complex changes in plain language
  - Highlight decisions that require human input
  - Provide clear options for decision points
  - Document assumptions made during development

